    "detailed_description": "Hungry Legion is a casual medieval fantasy action battle game. Manage one small group of warriors in a series of battles. After each battle you can expand your army with new troops. Battles get extremely challenging and death is always near you. Your troops can go through a lot but will eventually get exhausted if left without food for a very long time. So will the enemies...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Casual fast paced battles with procedurally generated armies in medieval fantasy style.<br></li><li>Fight through numerous obstacles on a landmass that is different every time you play<br></li><li>Each obstacle is a battle against a much larger enemy force<br></li><li>Battlefields are different every time you play, featuring plains, lakes, forests, deserts and other biomes.<br></li><li>Defeat enemies quickly to capture their food supply before they exhaust it<br></li><li>Small number of carefully designed weapons, armor and creatures (human, ghost, horse, bear etc) make up a diverse set of warrior types.<br></li><li>Units can carry other units as mounts, creating even more combinations.</li></ul>",
